{
  "manifest_version": 4,
  "ident": {
    "author_did": "did:bns:buckyos",
    "name": "todo"
  },
  "kind": "builtin",
  "version": 1,
  "title": "To-dos",
  "description": "A to-do list that is also a board: the records of a to-do table, ticked, reordered and moved between status columns.",
  "default_size": {
    "w": 420,
    "h": 520
  },
  "config_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "mode": {
        "enum": [
          "list",
          "board"
        ],
        "default": "list",
        "title": "View"
      },
      "hide_done": {
        "type": "boolean",
        "default": false,
        "title": "Hide completed"
      },
      "collapsed": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "title": "Folded columns (status options)"
      }
    }
  },
  "user_state": [
    "mode",
    "hide_done",
    "collapsed"
  ],
  "bindings": {
    "items": {
      "accepts": [
        "buckyos.table-source"
      ],
      "schema_id": "buckyos.todo@1",
      "required": true,
      "title": "To-do table",
      "owned": "created with the control"
    }
  },
  "templates": {
    "list_row": {
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "bg",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "body",
          "config": {
            "shape": "rect",
            "radius": 6,
            "fill": "{{item.row_fill}}",
            "stroke": "{{item.row_stroke}}",
            "stroke_width": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "check",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "check",
          "box": {
            "x": 8,
            "y": 9,
            "w": 20,
            "h": 20
          },
          "config": {
            "shape": "svg",
            "svg": {
              "viewBox": "0 0 20 20",
              "body": "<circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"8.5\" style=\"fill:var(--aiws-shape-fill);stroke:var(--aiws-shape-stroke);stroke-width:1.5\"/>"
            },
            "fill": "{{item.check_fill}}",
            "stroke": "{{item.check_stroke}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tick",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "check",
          "when": "{{item.done}}",
          "box": {
            "x": 8,
            "y": 9,
            "w": 20,
            "h": 20
          },
          "config": {
            "shape": "svg",
            "svg": {
              "viewBox": "0 0 20 20",
              "body": "<path d=\"M6 10.4l2.6 2.6L14 7.6\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--aiws-shape-stroke);stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round\"/>"
            },
            "fill": "none",
            "stroke": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "prio",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "body",
          "when": "{{item.priority_color}}",
          "box": {
            "x": 34,
            "y": 15,
            "w": 4,
            "h": 8
          },
          "config": {
            "shape": "rect",
            "radius": 2,
            "fill": "{{item.priority_color}}",
            "stroke": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "title",
          "view": "label",
          "role": "title",
          "edit": "title",
          "box": {
            "x": 42,
            "r": 104
          },
          "config": {
            "value": "{{item.title}}",
            "font_size": 14,
            "font_color": "{{item.title_color}}",
            "strike": "{{item.done}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "status",
          "view": "label",
          "role": "body",
          "when": "{{item.doing}}",
          "box": {
            "w": 72,
            "r": 100
          },
          "config": {
            "value": "{{item.status_label}}",
            "font_size": 11,
            "font_color": "accent",
            "align": "right"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "due",
          "view": "label",
          "role": "body",
          "box": {
            "w": 88,
            "r": 8
          },
          "config": {
            "value": "{{item.due}}",
            "format": "relative",
            "font_size": 12,
            "font_color": "{{item.due_color}}",
            "align": "right"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "note",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "body",
          "when": "{{item.noted}}",
          "box": {
            "x": 26,
            "y": 8,
            "w": 7,
            "h": 7
          },
          "config": {
            "shape": "ellipse",
            "fill": "warning",
            "stroke": "surface",
            "stroke_width": 1.5
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    "card": {
      "nodes": [
        {
          "id": "bg",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "body",
          "config": {
            "shape": "rect",
            "radius": 8,
            "fill": "surface",
            "stroke": "{{item.card_stroke}}",
            "stroke_width": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "prio",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "body",
          "when": "{{item.priority_color}}",
          "box": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 8,
            "w": 3,
            "b": 8
          },
          "config": {
            "shape": "rect",
            "radius": 1.5,
            "fill": "{{item.priority_color}}",
            "stroke": "none"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "check",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "check",
          "box": {
            "x": 10,
            "y": 10,
            "w": 18,
            "h": 18
          },
          "config": {
            "shape": "svg",
            "svg": {
              "viewBox": "0 0 20 20",
              "body": "<circle cx=\"10\" cy=\"10\" r=\"8.5\" style=\"fill:var(--aiws-shape-fill);stroke:var(--aiws-shape-stroke);stroke-width:1.5\"/>"
            },
            "fill": "{{item.check_fill}}",
            "stroke": "{{item.check_stroke}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tick",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "check",
          "when": "{{item.done}}",
          "box": {
            "x": 10,
            "y": 10,
            "w": 18,
            "h": 18
          },
          "config": {
            "shape": "svg",
            "svg": {
              "viewBox": "0 0 20 20",
              "body": "<path d=\"M6 10.4l2.6 2.6L14 7.6\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--aiws-shape-stroke);stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round\"/>"
            },
            "fill": "none",
            "stroke": "#ffffff"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "title",
          "view": "label",
          "role": "title",
          "edit": "title",
          "box": {
            "x": 36,
            "y": 9,
            "r": 10,
            "b": 6
          },
          "config": {
            "value": "{{item.title}}",
            "font_size": 13,
            "font_color": "{{item.title_color}}",
            "strike": "{{item.done}}",
            "wrap": true,
            "valign": "top"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "due",
          "view": "label",
          "role": "body",
          "when": "{{item.due}}",
          "box": {
            "x": 36,
            "h": 18,
            "b": 6,
            "w": 110
          },
          "config": {
            "value": "{{item.due}}",
            "format": "relative",
            "font_size": 11,
            "font_color": "{{item.due_color}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "tags",
          "view": "label",
          "role": "body",
          "when": "{{item.tags}}",
          "box": {
            "r": 10,
            "h": 18,
            "b": 6,
            "w": 110
          },
          "config": {
            "value": "{{item.tags}}",
            "font_size": 11,
            "font_color": "muted",
            "align": "right"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "note",
          "view": "shape",
          "role": "body",
          "when": "{{item.noted}}",
          "box": {
            "r": 6,
            "y": 6,
            "w": 7,
            "h": 7
          },
          "config": {
            "shape": "ellipse",
            "fill": "warning",
            "stroke": "none"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "layouts": {
    "list": {
      "algorithm": "list",
      "template": "list_row",
      "item": {
        "h": 38
      },
      "gap": 2,
      "order": "order",
      "groups": "open, then completed (folded)"
    },
    "board": {
      "algorithm": "columns",
      "template": "card",
      "by": "status",
      "column": {
        "w": 260
      },
      "gap": 8,
      "order": "order"
    }
  },
  "gestures": [
    {
      "role": "check",
      "press": "complete or reopen",
      "writes": "table.set_values status (done / the first other option), done_at"
    },
    {
      "role": "title",
      "edit": "title",
      "writes": "table.set_values title"
    },
    {
      "role": "body",
      "press": "select; a second press opens the details",
      "drag": "reorder (list, column) or move to another column",
      "writes": "table.set_values order (an order key between the neighbours), status"
    }
  ],
  "events": {},
  "actions": [
    {
      "id": "add",
      "title": "Add a to-do",
      "writes": "table.insert_records { title, status, order }"
    },
    {
      "id": "add_column",
      "title": "Add a column",
      "needs": [
        "structure"
      ],
      "writes": "table.add_option on status"
    },
    {
      "id": "copy_link",
      "title": "Copy link",
      "link": "?block=<control>&record=<record>"
    },
    {
      "id": "annotate",
      "title": "Annotate",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "table_record"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "open_page",
      "title": "Open as a page",
      "link": "?block=<control>&page=control"
    },
    {
      "id": "delete",
      "title": "Delete",
      "writes": "table.delete_records"
    }
  ],
  "agent": "# todo — the to-do control (list and board)\n\nA `buckyos.container` with `kind: \"todo\"` on a canvas. It shows one to-do table (a `buckyos.table-source` with\n`schema_id: \"buckyos.todo@1\"`) bound as `bindings.items`. **The items are the table's records**: to add, complete,\nmove or rename a to-do, write the table (`table.insert_records` / `table.set_values`), never Blocks — the control\nshows the change at once. Nothing is stored per item in the control.\n\n## The table (fields by id)\n\n| field | type | meaning |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `title` | text, required | the to-do |\n| `status` | select, required | a column of the board, in option order; option `done` means completed (default options `todo`, `doing`, `done`) |\n| `due` | date | due date |\n| `order` | text | an order key (base-36 fractional index, as `order_key`): list and column order |\n| `done_at` | datetime | when it was completed |\n| `ext` | json object | `priority` (low / normal / high / urgent), `tags` (strings), `assignee`, `reminders` |\n\nA record's body (`table.set_body`, a rich text under the table) holds its notes.\n\n## The control\n\n`payload: { kind: \"todo\", layout: { mode: \"data\" }, title?, bindings: { items: { entity_id: <table> } }, config? }` with a\nnumeric `placement { x, y, w, h }` (it holds no Blocks). `config` is the default view: `mode` (`list` | `board`),\n`hide_done` (boolean), `collapsed` (status option ids of folded columns). Each person's own view is their user state.\n\n## Place one\n\n`buckyos aiws place todo --workspace <ws> --surface <canvas> [--bind \"items=<table>\"]` runs the control's on_bind the\nway a person's insertion does: no to-do table in the workspace → one is created on the canvas (owned by the control),\nexactly one → it is shown, several → give `--bind` (the command fails with `NEEDS_UI` naming the binding). It answers the\ncontrol's id and the table it shows; add items with `table.insert_records` or `buckyos aiws todo` (for the schedule).\n\n## By hand (doc.commit)\n\nOnly when the command is not at hand: create the table and the control in one Commit.\n\n```json\n{ \"op\": \"entity.create\", \"entity_id\": \"todo1\", \"type_id\": \"buckyos.table-source\", \"schema_id\": \"buckyos.todo@1\", \"parent_id\": \"<content folder>\",\n  \"order_key\": \"a\", \"payload\": { \"title_field_id\": \"title\", \"fields\": [\n    { \"field_id\": \"title\", \"name\": \"Title\", \"type\": \"text\", \"required\": true },\n    { \"field_id\": \"status\", \"name\": \"Status\", \"type\": \"select\", \"required\": true, \"options\": [{ \"option_id\": \"todo\", \"label\": \"To do\" }, { \"option_id\": \"doing\", \"label\": \"In progress\" }, { \"option_id\": \"done\", \"label\": \"Done\" }] },\n    { \"field_id\": \"due\", \"name\": \"Due\", \"type\": \"date\", \"nullable\": true }, { \"field_id\": \"order\", \"name\": \"Order\", \"type\": \"text\", \"nullable\": true },\n    { \"field_id\": \"done_at\", \"name\": \"Completed\", \"type\": \"datetime\", \"nullable\": true }, { \"field_id\": \"ext\", \"name\": \"Extension\", \"type\": \"json\", \"nullable\": true }] } }\n{ \"op\": \"entity.create\", \"entity_id\": \"todoctl1\", \"type_id\": \"buckyos.container\", \"parent_id\": \"<surface>\", \"order_key\": \"b\",\n  \"placement\": { \"x\": 40, \"y\": 40, \"w\": 420, \"h\": 560 }, \"payload\": { \"kind\": \"todo\", \"layout\": { \"mode\": \"data\" }, \"bindings\": { \"items\": { \"entity_id\": \"todo1\" } } } }\n{ \"op\": \"table.insert_records\", \"source_id\": \"todo1\", \"records\": [{ \"record_id\": \"t1\", \"values\": { \"title\": \"Buy milk\", \"status\": \"todo\", \"order\": \"i\" } }] }\n```\n\nThe placement is numbers (never `\"auto\"`): a data control is sized like a Block.\n\n## The private schedule\n\nEvery person has a Workspace named `schedule` (`ws.ensure { name: \"schedule\" }`) whose to-do table has the fixed id\n`todo` (and calendar `calendar`). Use the `buckyos aiws todo` commands (or buckyos-websdk `ScheduleClient`) to\nread and change it.\n"
}
